{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107698","id":2603601295,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6bL82P","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107698","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107698.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107698.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107698","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107698/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107698/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107698/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/37b7f577adf60e690323057f99bec796c9f801c9","number":107698,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix GLES3 stereo output (sRGB + lens distortion)","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR fixes two issues in the compatibility renderer.\r\n\r\nFirst, when using OpenXR we have to use `GL_SRGB8_ALPHA8` buffers to render to. This triggers a hardware sRGB->Linear conversion when we are reading from this buffer with our final blit to screen. We need to revert that conversion to get proper colors.\r\n\r\nFixes #107655\r\n\r\nSecond, we never copied over our lens distortion shader used by our `MobileVRInterface` implementation. This is thus a long standing regression from Godot 3.6 that stops people from using Godot with cardboard-ish phone VR (which yes, still gets used to this day).\r\n\r\nThis can be tested with: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/pull/1212","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ